<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Leading Spirit shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Leading Spirit shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Leading Spirit (Holdings) Co Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an annnouncement, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
